Cumulative iOS build + mobile UI/GUI parity patch

Applies to commit f3d8131985b6866354e8545e0c75b626d66e0048.
It produces the final files currently in C:\Users\RDP\Documents\add.

Fixes:
- run #173: referenced net6.0 project restore assets were overwritten
- run #175: MAUI Color vs ImageSharp Color ambiguity in MainPage.xaml.cs
- run #176: invalid XSAppIconAssets requirement in the unsigned-IPA validator
- runtime: link Kyaru's iOS Texture2DDecoderNative.framework and resolve it from
  the embedded Frameworks path so ASTC/ETC/PVRTC/BC textures decode on device
  instead of reporting a missing native decoder
- mesh preview: full desktop-equivalent render controls (solid, wireframe,
  solid + wireframe), lit/unlit shading using the desktop hemisphere shader,
  calculated/source normals with skinned and blend-shape transforms, reset view,
  CadetBlue background, black wireframe, statistics/help text, and OBJ sharing
- desktop parity: export options page/settings, texture channels, mesh and scene
  preview, font specimens, class sorting/version grouping/status metadata, Model
  menu animation actions, archive/model export extensions, static iOS FBX options,
  asset-filter debounce, parser logging, inline mesh/scene preview, filter types,
  dropped folders, class-structure text exports, exact desktop strings, status text,
  share-after-export toggle, desktop options hints, audio labels/timing, hierarchy
  checkbox behavior, context-menu order, class columns, and export artifact names
